SOURCE_BOUNDS_ROOT,source_envelope_linear_prefix,⊢ ∀initialError delta N.
    0 ≤ delta ∧ initialError + 3 * &N * delta ≤ 1 ⇒
    ∀n. n ≤ N ⇒
        source_error_envelope initialError delta delta n ≤
        initialError + 3 * &n * delta
SOURCE_BOUNDS_ROOT,source_raw_envelope_lt_dyadic96,⊢ ∀n. n ≤ 90000 ⇒
      source_error_envelope (1 / 2 pow 98) (1 / 2 pow 120) (1 / 2 pow 120) n <
      1 / 2 pow 96
SOURCE_BOUNDS_ROOT,source_raw_state_error_lt_dyadic96,⊢ ∀initial step exact w.
    modu (exact 0) ≤ 1 ∧ modu w = 1 ∧ (∀n. exact (SUC n) = exact n * w) ∧
    modu (source_pair_value (2 ** 120) initial − exact 0) ≤ 1 / 2 pow 98 ∧
    modu (source_pair_value (2 ** 122) step − w) ≤ 1 / 2 pow 120 ⇒
    ∀n. n ≤ 90000 ⇒
        modu
          (source_pair_value (2 ** 120)
             (source_state (2 ** 122) initial step n) − exact n) <
        1 / 2 pow 96
